== URL shortener (transformer) ==

Example: https://google.com -> https://s.anton2920.ru/ahdfknawbdkawbrkawb.

xxx-xxxx-xxx

Requirements:

- Shortening:
	- No transforming of transformed.
	- URL format verification.
	- Secure.

- Users:
	- 'Annonymous' user exists.
		- Unique link leads to unique short.
	- Shortening:
		- Allow custom links.
		- Allow private links.
	- Stats:
		- Redirects per period.
		- From where?
	- TTL (optional).

Descisions:

- No users or Users or [Both].
- Endless or Expiry or [Both].
- Automatic or [Both (Auto + Manual)].
- Store near or far.

